vision:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{0.01}^{6}}{{0.01}^{8}}={0.01}^{6}÷{0.01}^{8}\n$$\n\nTo divide powers of the same base, we simply subtract the exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0.01}^{6}÷{0.01}^{8} & ={0.01}^{6-8} \\\\  & ={0.01}^{-2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6a43851d-f1ae-55ee-ba67-6621c9a66941"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6a43851d-f1ae-55ee-ba67-6621c9a66941" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a43851d-f1ae-55ee-ba67-6621c9a66941" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-47a3b626-320b-56e8-91a8-0c9fd9d1af96" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9b5b4740-07d1-5fa3-b3af-3343d1bc13a5" "answer-47a3b626-320b-56e8-91a8-0c9fd9d1af96" "answer-128c0a38-e684-5745-984c-b55990ba8da2" "answer-aed9babb-208b-5a77-bc14-20439075838b" "answer-dca00683-6888-55fd-8e20-ae0ad7a5b748"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b5b4740-07d1-5fa3-b3af-3343d1bc13a5" :answer/id #uuid "9b5b4740-07d1-5fa3-b3af-3343d1bc13a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47a3b626-320b-56e8-91a8-0c9fd9d1af96" :answer/id #uuid "47a3b626-320b-56e8-91a8-0c9fd9d1af96" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0.01}^{-2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-128c0a38-e684-5745-984c-b55990ba8da2" :answer/id #uuid "128c0a38-e684-5745-984c-b55990ba8da2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0.01}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aed9babb-208b-5a77-bc14-20439075838b" :answer/id #uuid "aed9babb-208b-5a77-bc14-20439075838b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0.01}^{3/4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dca00683-6888-55fd-8e20-ae0ad7a5b748" :answer/id #uuid "dca00683-6888-55fd-8e20-ae0ad7a5b748" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0.01}^{4/3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4c73aa99-debd-5794-8ba7-65ccf