} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{7} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f9658bd1-b07d-5909-8e50-bb388a4e036f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f9658bd1-b07d-5909-8e50-bb388a4e036f" :answer-field/id #uuid "f9658bd1-b07d-5909-8e50-bb388a4e036f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e126a8cc-71d1-5b99-a0a2-2f8c634f63c5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-151cc72e-9a16-5fea-b5af-cfb0164f5ded" "answer-59c29fb2-4f87-5b2d-a98f-846bafb443e4" "answer-e126a8cc-71d1-5b99-a0a2-2f8c634f63c5" "answer-53bc57ef-fd28-5eea-a280-1cc2b4078d55" "answer-a3bc7f92-5853-5b1b-982b-ca40ed08990a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-151cc72e-9a16-5fea-b5af-cfb0164f5ded" :answer/id #uuid "151cc72e-9a16-5fea-b5af-cfb0164f5ded" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{7}}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59c29fb2-4f87-5b2d-a98f-846bafb443e4" :answer/id #uuid "59c29fb2-4f87-5b2d-a98f-846bafb443e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4\\sqrt{7}}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e126a8cc-71d1-5b99-a0a2-2f8c634f63c5" :answer/id #uuid "e126a8cc-71d1-5b99-a0a2-2f8c634f63c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-53bc57ef-fd28-5eea-a280-1cc2b4078d55" :answer/id #uuid "53bc57ef-fd28-5eea-a280-1cc2b4078d55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a3bc7f92-5853-5b1b-982b-ca40ed08990a" :answer/id #uuid "a3bc7f92-5853-5b1b-982b-ca40ed08990a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{14}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-deb54481-2dc5-5793-afb9-1c365b9534d3" :question/id #uuid "deb54481-2dc5-5793-afb9-1c365b9534d3" :question/math-academy-id "q-99629" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{3}}=$" :question/worked-solution "To remove the radical $\\sqrt{3}$ from the denominator, all we need to do is multiply both the numerator and denominator by $\\sqrt{3}$ and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{7}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{7}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}}{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the product rule to simplify the numerator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{7}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}}{3} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{7\\cdot 3}}{3} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f98bd79a-0814-5c23-84d8-a87462865c4c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f98bd79a-0814-5c23-84d8-a87462865c4c" :answer-field/id #uuid "f98bd79a-0814-5c23-84d8-a87462865c4c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-49291e93-d649-55d2-b573-9b986e710430" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2f1f2703-5367-5c21-9190-e63102f56cf4" "answer-49291e93-d649-55d2-b573-9b986e710430" "answer-ea8f5845-ec9c-5e33-a9c3-c45aec206f83" "answer-042b1b97-adf6-559c-aee7-f638bcb993a6" "answer-c70e80f3-3635-5335-b184-577286a23d45"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2f1f2703-5367-5c21-9190-e63102f56cf4" :answer/id #uuid "2f1f2703-5367-5c21-9190-e63102f56cf4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7\\sqrt{21}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-49291e93-d649-55d2-b573-9b986e710430" :answer/id #uuid "49291e93-d649-55d2-b573-9b986e710430" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ea8f5845-ec9c-5e33-a9c3-c45aec206f83" :answer/id #uuid "ea8f5845-ec9c-5e33-a9c3-c45aec206f83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{21}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]